{
  "name": "build_improvement_accept",
  "description": "SPEC/game/extraction-and-improvements.md: build_improvement accepted when tile has resource, level < 4, and player has tech for next level. Asserts order accepted (turn 1 improvement 0) and tile shows Farm at turn 2; completion to level 1 covered by unit tests. Two land tiles in p1 so the target is not capital/town (town/capital occupancy strips resources on those tiles).",
  "init": {
